    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 19 The Laurels is a well-proportioned three-bedroom mid-terrace home extending to approximately 78m² and presented in good condition. The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, comfortable living room and a spacious kitchen/dining room. \n\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, each benefiting from fitted wardrobes, together with a family bathroom. The property has a C energy rating, gas-fired central heating, front and rear gardens, and the added convenience of off-street parking.\n\nThe Laurels is a well-established residential development on the Tullow Road, within walking distance of local schools, shops and everyday amenities. Carlow town centre is easily accessible, while the property is also conveniently positioned close to key commuting routes serving the surrounding areas.\n\nCurrently owner-occupied, this home represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers seeking to establish themselves in a convenient Carlow location. \n\nIt will also appeal to investors looking for a well-located property with strong rental potential. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Kehoe Auctioneers today to arrange your appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom, close to schools & shopping areas </li><li> Front & rear garden and off street parking </li><li> Gas central heating - C BER </li><li> Living room to front with gas inset fire </li><li> Kitchen dining room has tiled floor and over looks rear garden </li><li> Small private rear garden - low maintenance </li><li> Fitted wardrobes in all bedrooms </li><li> Walking distance of schools and shopping area </li><li> Close to commuting routes - off the Tullow Rd</li></ul>"
      },
      {
